The '''Dread Mask''' is obtained from [[Lars Bridgeater]] in [[Cathedral of Flames]] for 25 [[Golden Rin Relic]]s. It has an [[Item's Attribute]] +1 bonus.

== Dye ==
[[Dye]] affects the face of the mask but does not affect the eyes, hair, horn-like protrusions, and the grey area around the mouth.
